<title>USA: TriTeal to offer 2.5 mln shares.</title>
<headline>TriTeal to offer 2.5 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>CARLSBAD, Calif. 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>TriTeal Corp said Monday it plans an underwritten public offering of approximately 2.5 million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The shares will be sold by the company and certain selling stockholders. The company said in a statement it expects that, of the shares offered, about 1.25 million shares will be sold by the company as newly issued common stock.</p>
<p>The company said it plans to file a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission on or about January 29.</p>
</text>
